This project's Inochi2D model loading/rendering engine (`src/lib/inochi2d/`)
and puppet editor (`src/editor/`) are a JavaScript/TypeScript translation of,
and/or based on, the data models, file formats, and algorithms defined by the
following upstream projects, both created by the Inochi2D Project and
distributed under the BSD 2-Clause License:

- Inochi2D — https://github.com/Inochi2D/inochi2d
- Inochi Creator — https://github.com/Inochi2D/inochi-creator

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for full upstream attribution and license text.
